---
date: 2025-11-04T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Sentience Distributor is a small arcane device that came with the radar dish taken from the roof of a roller rink. It spreads the signal the dish receives. It is fragile, and it is not known whether it was made for this particular use or is a general item that someone put to it. Anzu recognized it by name and asked to spend time with it alone. Anzu spent an evening studying it. The runes written across the device are bundled in a shape that looks almost like sheet music, and the sheet seems built to harmonize with whatever signal comes in so that the signal is spread. The signal itself settles into the non-sentient objects around the device and wakes them.
